-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>BANDO KAZUAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>BANDO KIKO CO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>BANDO KIKO CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>BANDO, KAZUAKI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>BANDO KAZUAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>BANDO, KAZUAKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A sheet glass working machine, comprising a cutting part (1) which forms a cut line for snapping sheet glass pane material (22) in the sheet glass material (22), a polishing part (2) which polishes the edges of the sheet glass snapped along the cut line, a sheet glass transfer part (4) which feeds the sheet glass in order through these cutting part (1) and polishing part (2), and control means (CNT) which are connected to the cutting part (1) and the polishing part (2) to control them, respectively.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une machine à travailler le verre à vitres, cette machine comprenant une partie coupe (1) destinée à former une ligne de coupe permettant de cisailler le verre à vitres sous forme de plats (22), une partie polissage (2) permettant de polir les bords du verre à vitres cisaillé le long de ladite ligne de coupe, une partie transfert du verre à vitres (4) conçue pour introduire le verre à vitres dans les parties découpe (1) et polissage (2), et enfin des organes de commande (CNT) connectés à ces parties coupe (1) et polissage (2) afin de régir chacune d'entre elles.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>